      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而在那之中，唯有救世主同学，\n绽放出那种光辉――\n并且确实抓住了孩子们的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33dcdda5c1e5b6787733a5c9411981d7f499f399c851b4079a7d58c82b2da1d4",
